static / reviewdog (diff-only)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-24T15:25:02.6576382Z     		"github-check"
static / reviewdog (diff-only)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-24T15:25:02.6576951Z     			Report results to GitHub Check. It works both for Pull Requests and commits.
static / reviewdog (diff-only)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-24T15:25:02.6577785Z     			For Pull Request, you can see report results in GitHub PullRequest Check
static / reviewdog (diff-only)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-24T15:25:02.6578442Z     			tab and can control filtering mode by -filter-mode flag.
