static / reviewdog (diff-only)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-24T15:25:02.6590049Z     	
static / reviewdog (diff-only)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-24T15:25:02.6590602Z     		"github-pr-review"
static / reviewdog (diff-only)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-24T15:25:02.6591105Z     			Report results to GitHub review comments.
static / reviewdog (diff-only)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-24T15:25:02.6591608Z     	
static / reviewdog (diff-only)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-24T15:25:02.6592110Z     			1. Set REVIEWDOG_GITHUB_API_TOKEN environment variable.
static / reviewdog (diff-only)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-24T15:25:02.6592824Z     			Go to https://github.com/settings/tokens and create new Personal access token with repo scope.
