static / reviewdog (diff-only)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-24T15:25:02.6593903Z     			For GitHub Enterprise:
static / reviewdog (diff-only)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-24T15:25:02.6594489Z     				$ export GITHUB_API="https://example.githubenterprise.com/api/v3"
