static / reviewdog (diff-only)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-24T15:25:02.6595509Z     		"github-annotations"
static / reviewdog (diff-only)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-24T15:25:02.6596065Z     			Report results to stdout in GitHub Actions annotation format.
static / reviewdog (diff-only)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-24T15:25:02.6596615Z     	
static / reviewdog (diff-only)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-24T15:25:02.6597065Z     		"github-pr-annotations"
static / reviewdog (diff-only)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-24T15:25:02.6597835Z     			Same as github-annotations reporter but it only supports Pull Requests.
static / reviewdog (diff-only)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-24T15:25:02.6598412Z     	
static / reviewdog (diff-only)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-24T15:25:02.6598870Z     		"gitlab-mr-discussion"
static / reviewdog (diff-only)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-24T15:25:02.6599410Z     			Report results to GitLab MergeRequest discussion.
static / reviewdog (diff-only)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-24T15:25:02.6599929Z     	
static / reviewdog (diff-only)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-24T15:25:02.6600457Z     			1. Set REVIEWDOG_GITLAB_API_TOKEN environment variable.
static / reviewdog (diff-only)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-24T15:25:02.6601080Z     			Go to https://gitlab.com/profile/personal_access_tokens
static / reviewdog (diff-only)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-24T15:25:02.6601612Z     	
static / reviewdog (diff-only)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-24T15:25:02.6602196Z     			CI_API_V4_URL (defined by Gitlab CI) as the base URL for the Gitlab API automatically.
static / reviewdog (diff-only)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-24T15:25:02.6602968Z     			Alternatively, GITLAB_API can also be defined, and it will take precedence over the former:
static / reviewdog (diff-only)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-24T15:25:02.6603780Z     				$ export GITLAB_API="https://example.gitlab.com/api/v4"
static / reviewdog (diff-only)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-24T15:25:02.6604317Z     	
static / reviewdog (diff-only)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-24T15:25:02.6604755Z     		"gitlab-mr-commit"
static / reviewdog (diff-only)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-24T15:25:02.6605336Z     			Same as gitlab-mr-discussion, but report results to GitLab comments for
static / reviewdog (diff-only)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-24T15:25:02.6605959Z     			each commits in Merge Requests.
