static / reviewdog (diff-only)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-24T15:25:02.6608709Z     			1. Set GERRIT_USERNAME and GERRIT_PASSWORD for basic authentication or
static / reviewdog (diff-only)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-24T15:25:02.6609369Z     			GIT_GITCOOKIE_PATH for git cookie based authentication.
