static / reviewdog (diff-only)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-24T15:25:02.6613833Z     	
static / reviewdog (diff-only)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-24T15:25:02.6614283Z     		"bitbucket-code-report"
static / reviewdog (diff-only)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-24T15:25:02.6614830Z     			Create Bitbucket Code Report via Code Insights
static / reviewdog (diff-only)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-24T15:25:02.6615472Z     			(https://confluence.atlassian.com/display/BITBUCKET/Code+insights).
static / reviewdog (diff-only)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-24T15:25:02.6616153Z     			You can set custom report name with:
static / reviewdog (diff-only)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-24T15:25:02.6616656Z     	
static / reviewdog (diff-only)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-24T15:25:02.6617365Z     			If running as part of Bitbucket Pipelines no additional configurations is needed.
static / reviewdog (diff-only)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-24T15:25:02.6618094Z     			If running outside of Bitbucket Pipelines you need to provide git repo data
static / reviewdog (diff-only)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-24T15:25:02.6618799Z     			(see documentation below for local reporters) and BitBucket credentials:
static / reviewdog (diff-only)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-24T15:25:02.6619465Z     			- For Basic Auth you need to set following env variables:
static / reviewdog (diff-only)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-24T15:25:02.6620051Z     				  BITBUCKET_USER and BITBUCKET_PASSWORD
static / reviewdog (diff-only)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-24T15:25:02.6620648Z     			- For AccessToken Auth you need to set BITBUCKET_ACCESS_TOKEN
static / reviewdog (diff-only)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-24T15:25:02.6621196Z     	
static / reviewdog (diff-only)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-24T15:25:02.6621725Z     			To post results to Bitbucket Server specify BITBUCKET_SERVER_URL.
static / reviewdog (diff-only)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-24T15:25:02.6622278Z     	
static / reviewdog (diff-only)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-24T15:25:02.6622814Z     		"gitea-pr-review"
static / reviewdog (diff-only)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-24T15:25:02.6623320Z     			Report results to Gitea review comments.
static / reviewdog (diff-only)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-24T15:25:02.6623817Z     	
